{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 04 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">视觉 Transformer：全局交互、层级窗口与高分辨率代价</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision Transformers</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_021_vision_transformer__vit-title\">Vision Transformer (ViT)</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">非重叠 patch 线性 token 化、CLS 汇聚与全局 Transformer encoder，完全移除卷积主干。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Splits images into non-overlapping patches, linearly projects them into tokens with positional embeddings, and processes them via a pure global Transformer encoder.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">固定分辨率二维图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Fixed-resolution 2D image (or 3D sub-volume patches)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">CLS 全局表征或类别概率</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Global [CLS] representation, patch token grid, or classification logits</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=YicbFdNTTy\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Vision Transformer (ViT) original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/1488994ba7ff1b9b6ebd.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像被规则切成互不重叠的 P×P 区块。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests fixed-resolution 2d image (or 3d sub-volume patches) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像被规则切成互不重叠的 P×P 区块。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests fixed-resolution 2d image (or 3d sub-volume patches) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像被规则切成互不重叠的 P×P 区块。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests fixed-resolution 2d image (or 3d sub-volume patches) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个 patch 展平，使二维空间问题变成长度 N 的序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Patchify to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Patchify\" data-node-name-en=\"Patchify\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patchify</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个 patch 展平，使二维空间问题变成长度 N 的序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Patchify to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"共享线性投影把每个 patch 映射到 D 维 token。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch embedding within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"线性 Patch 嵌入\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">线性 Patch 嵌入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Patch embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">共享线性投影把每个 patch 映射到 D 维 token。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch embedding within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"序列前置可学习 CLS token，并叠加可学习绝对位置编码。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CLS + within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"CLS + 位置\" data-node-name-en=\"CLS +\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CLS + 位置</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CLS +</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">序列前置可学习 CLS token，并叠加可学习绝对位置编码。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CLS + within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"所有 patch token 在每层内进行全局多头自注意力。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs global MSA within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"全局 MSA\" data-node-name-en=\"global MSA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局 MSA</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global MSA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">所有 patch token 在每层内进行全局多头自注意力。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs global MSA within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"两层前馈网络逐 token 做通道变换；MSA 与 MLP 均带 pre-norm residual。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MLP Block within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"MLP Block\" data-node-name-en=\"MLP Block\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>MLP Block</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">两层前馈网络逐 token 做通道变换；MSA 与 MLP 均带 pre-norm residual。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MLP Block within the core patch token encoder computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重复 Transformer encoder，空间分辨率与 token 数保持不变。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies L× Encoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"L× Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"L× Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>L× Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重复 Transformer encoder，空间分辨率与 token 数保持不变。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies L× Encoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"取最终 CLS 状态，经 LayerNorm 与线性头完成分类。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces global [cls] representation, patch token grid, or classification logits via CLS Head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"CLS Head\" data-node-name-en=\"CLS Head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_021_vision_transformer__vit', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CLS Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">取最终 CLS 状态，经 LayerNorm 与线性头完成分类。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces global [cls] representation, patch token grid, or classification logits via CLS Head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Vision Transformer (ViT) Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · ViT 将图像块线性映射为带位置的 token 序列</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Non-Overlapping Patch Tokenization &amp; Global Self-Attention Encoding</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Vision Transformer (ViT)：核心公式 · ViT 将图像块线性映射为带位置的 token 序列\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"21\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.958656pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.791958 -69.000129 141.034073 12.958656\" width=\"141.034073pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.854412-4.615421V-4.73135H4.260389V-4.615421C4.73135-4.579194 4.840034-4.506738 4.847279-4.245898C4.847279-4.158951 4.832788-4.07925 4.782069-3.927093C4.513984-2.98517 4.231407-2.057739 3.956075-1.115816L2.115703-4.73135H.739047V-4.615421C1.130307-4.586439 1.318692-4.492247 1.470849-4.20967L.644855-1.188272C.362278-.26084 .304313-.173893-.166648-.115929L-.159402 0H1.48534L1.478094-.115929C1.04